    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">1</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 1:</strong> 490 × 30 = 14 700</p>
