    <p style="margin:0;"><span style="display:inline-block;min-width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;color:#0b1220;font-weight:bold;margin-right:8px;">3</span><strong style="color:#bae6fd;">Step 3:</strong> Exact: 486 × 32 = 15 552</p>
